# Fail-safe allowlist for the Claude config dir.
#
# Ignore EVERYTHING here by default, then re-include only the curated config we track.
# Claude writes secrets (.credentials.json) and runtime state into the live ~/.claude;
# after the source/runtime split (scripts/link.ps1) those live outside this repo entirely,
# but this allowlist guarantees that even if the live dir is ever pointed back at this
# path, no secret or runtime artifact can be committed. New runtime files are ignored by
# default — only things added below are tracked. See README.md.

/*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!instructions/
!skills/
!agents/
!commands/
!hooks/
!output-styles/
!scripts/
